WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.958
SIMU LIU
Hey everyone, Simu Liu here,

00:00:02.008 --> 00:00:03.786
and I'm with my fellow
castmates Awkwafina and Meng'er

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:06.474
from Marvel Studios' Shang-Chi
and the Legend of the Ten Rings,

00:00:06.524 --> 00:00:09.896
and today, we're gonna answer
some rapid-fire questions. You ready?

00:00:09.946 --> 00:00:10.919
AWKWAFINA
Let's do this!

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:12.054
MENG'ER ZHANG
Here we go!

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:13.987
AWKWAFINA
Fun.

00:00:14.037 --> 00:00:14.510
SIMU LIU
Dangerous.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:15.112
AWKWAFINA
Frisky.

00:00:15.162 --> 00:00:15.682
SIMU LIU
Fierce.

00:00:15.732 --> 00:00:16.729
MENG'ER ZHANG
Kick a lot of...

00:00:16.779 --> 00:00:17.684
SHANG-CHI
[Grunts]

00:00:17.834 --> 00:00:19.834
MENG'ER ZHANG
Oh, sorry, that's too many words.

00:00:20.732 --> 00:00:22.732
SIMU LIU
I can move my ears.

00:00:23.568 --> 00:00:25.635
MENG'ER ZHANG
I eat a lot. That counts, right?

00:00:25.685 --> 00:00:27.672
AWKWAFINA
I can walk into a room and say something

00:00:27.722 --> 00:00:31.550
about my acid reflux
and everyone slowly leaves.

00:00:32.144 --> 00:00:33.075
SHANG-CHI
Okay.

00:00:34.839 --> 00:00:35.594
SIMU LIU
Bungee jumping.

00:00:35.644 --> 00:00:36.461
MENG'ER ZHANG
Skydiving.

00:00:36.511 --> 00:00:39.078
AWKWAFINA
I've always wanted to jump into a split

00:00:39.128 --> 00:00:41.474
when no one was expecting it, like...

00:00:41.524 --> 00:00:47.641
[Laughs] Like in Walgreens, you know?
And it's like oh, I can do something.

00:00:47.691 --> 00:00:48.966
XIALING
What are you talking about?

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:52.845
SIMU LIU
They play a big role in the origin story

00:00:52.895 --> 00:00:57.808
of Iron Man and now you're gonna see how
it factors into this character, Shang-Chi.

00:00:58.895 --> 00:01:01.895
MENG'ER ZHANG
It's so heartwarming and so much love.

00:01:02.221 --> 00:01:04.944
AWKWAFINA
It is going to show you a part of the MCU

00:01:04.994 --> 00:01:06.749
that we have never explored.

00:01:06.799 --> 00:01:08.218
SIMU LIU
Action sequences

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:10.279
like you have never seen before.

00:01:14.487 --> 00:01:15.348
- Don't miss...
- Don't miss...

00:01:15.398 --> 00:01:16.552
AWKWAFINA
Don't miss Marvel Studios'

00:01:16.602 --> 00:01:18.829
Shang-Chi and the
Legend of the Ten Rings.

00:01:21.578 --> 00:01:22.499
SIMU LIU
Go see the movie!

